@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+@ Talking to the following Pokemon (PC port, see src/follower.c).
+@ FollowerInteract picks what it says into gStringVar4 and sets VAR_RESULT:
+@ 0 a message, 1 a Yes/No question, 2 an item it found (Yes/No to take it).
+
+EventScript_Follower::
+	lock
+	faceplayer
+	special FollowerInteract
+	waitstate
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, 1, EventScript_FollowerAnswer
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, 2, EventScript_FollowerAnswer
+	msgbox gStringVar4, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
+	release
+	end
+
+@ FollowerAnswer leaves VAR_RESULT TRUE (and the item in VAR_0x8004) if the
+@ found item is to be given.
+EventScript_FollowerAnswer:
+	msgbox gStringVar4, MSGBOX_YESNO
+	special FollowerAnswer
+	waitstate
+	msgbox gStringVar4, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, EventScript_FollowerEnd
+	giveitem VAR_0x8004
+EventScript_FollowerEnd:
+	release
+	end
